  "minion_rule": "Chapter antagonists of role 'minion' come from the villain type's lieutenant_pref plus 'bandit', filtered by location and rules mode; relax to the full compatible set if empty.",
  "rules": [
    "Three acts; the last chapter of Act I and of Act II ends with a rolled twist whose two hints were delivered in earlier chapters.",
    "No two adjacent chapters share a type; each pillar's mean intended share is at least 25 percent; fix by rerolling a mutable slot (recorded as repair).",
    "At least one 'lieutenant' chapter precedes the finale; campaigns of 9 or 10 chapters have two.",
    "Every chapter delivers three leads (private clue, victory recap, contact line) aimed at the two earliest unresolved nodes; each node needs at least 3 clues from at least 2 vehicles by its needed_by slot.",
    "Rescue rule: if a node has fewer than 3 delivered clues at its deadline, the next chapter's public recap line carries a missing clue.",
    "Clock: +1 when a chapter ends in defeat, +1 at each act break, +1 when a lieutenant escapes; never decreases except by a milestone noted in the record.",
    "Rest: a chapter that ends in victory offers the Short Rest; a rest-interlude slot is a recap screen between chapters, not a pack.",
    "Milestone reward after every act; levels are v2 (engine missing)."
  ],
